        "Content": "Exceptional 3 Bedroom Home Prime Location Short-Term Let ?2,500 Per Month\n\nSheehy Meares Real Estate are delighted to present this stunning three-bedroom two bathroom residence available for short term letting at ?2,500 per month.\n\nThe location is second to none offering an exceptional level of convenience while still providing all the comfort of a beautifully presented home.\n\nFinished to an excellent standard throughout the property offers bright spacious and stylish accommodation with a modern welcoming feel from the moment you step inside. A particular feature is the underfloor heating providing superb comfort throughout the home.\n\nThe accommodation is thoughtfully laid out and includes generous living space a contemporary kitchen three well proportioned bedrooms and two bathrooms all presented in excellent condition.\n\nThis is a turnkey property in an outstanding location combining quality, comfort and convenience a rare offering on the short term rental market."
